amily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2930" y="860" width="240" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lc9" value="&lt;b&gt;LANECTRL-09&lt;/b&gt; · CAN node 9&lt;br&gt;7 × H-bridge + TVS · 7 × feedback · 7 × button + LED on board&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#7C858E&quot;&gt;24 V in (F9) · 12 V via bus cable · front of row&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BE3A2B;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2570" y="960" width="270" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lanes9" value="&lt;b&gt;7 × lane&lt;/b&gt; · CB002-24V-573mm&lt;br&gt;24 V · ≤0.2 A idle · 5.8 cm/s · ≤6 kg&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#7C858E&quot;&gt;button + LED per lane, on LANECTRL-09&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#171A1F;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2930" y="960" width="240" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lc10" value="&lt;b&gt;LANECTRL-10&lt;/b&gt; · node 10 · bus entry&lt;br&gt;7 × H-bridge + TVS · 7 × feedback · 7 × button + LED on board&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#7C858E&quot;&gt;24 V in (F10) · 12 V via bus cable · front of row&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BE3A2B;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2570" y="1060" width="270" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lanes10" value="&lt;b&gt;7 × lane&lt;/b&gt; · CB002-24V-573mm&lt;br&gt;24 V · ≤0.2 A idle · 5.8 cm/s · ≤6 kg&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#7C858E&quot;&gt;button + LED per lane, on LANECTRL-10&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#171A1F;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2930" y="1060" width="240" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lane_note" value="LANECTRL = one board per row at the front edge of the row: the 7 lane buttons and 7 LEDs sit on the board behind the lane bezel, the 7 conveyor leads (W27, ferrules into the conveyor 3-pos screw terminal) run back to the conveyors. Row cables: 7 internal + 2 external (24 V feeder from the bus bar, CAN + 12 V bus). CAN + 12 V enters at LANECTRL-10 (nearest the cabinet) and daisy-chains upward; 120 Ω at LANECTRL-01. Lane n → row n ÷ 7, channel n mod 7." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5158;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2570" y="1170" width="600" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#BE3A2B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; DC power (bold): 24 V / derived 12 V &amp;nbsp; ━━ AC / motor phases &amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&quot;#1D5FA8&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; data / control &amp;nbsp; ┄┄ unconfirmed / wireless" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5158;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=#D4D9E0;fillColor=#F0F2F5;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1390" width="1000" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tables_ref" value="&lt;b&gt;R26:&lt;/b&gt; single 24 V PSU; 24→12 V conversion on SYSCTRL; W07 = 24 V input, W04 = SYSCTRL 12 V output. F14 lane branch is on SYSCTRL. &lt;b&gt;R23 Excel is historical and not aligned:&lt;/b&gt; power, fuse and cable entries need revision. W35/F18 provisional; W02/W31/W32 retired." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5158;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=#D4D9E0;fillColor=#F7EEDC;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x=